&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Experience optimizing ML software for hardware accelerators (e.g., GPUs, TPUs, custom silicon).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
